textual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p071","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m005-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:p005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m002-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:p002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0148","start":148,"end":150,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005","chapter_id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-jin035-allusion-p016-128","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","surfaces":["神農"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016","quote":"時天下暫寧，頠奏修國學，刻石寫經。皇太子既講，釋奠祀孔子，飲饗射侯，甚有儀序。又令荀籓終父勖之志，鑄鐘鑿磬，以備郊廟朝享禮樂。頠通博多聞，兼明醫術。荀勖之修律度也，檢得古尺，短世所用四分有餘。頠上言：「宜改諸度量。若未能悉革，可先改太醫權衡。此若差違，遂失神農、岐伯之正。藥物輕重，分兩乖互，所可傷夭，為害尤深。古壽考而今短折者，未必不由此也。」卒不能用。樂廣嘗與頠清言，欲以理服之，而頠辭論豐博，廣笑而不言。時人謂頠為言談之林藪。","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0128"]}],"rationale":"神農岐伯之正指醫藥先賢並稱，人物典故而非本段引書；保留legendary_tradition，不接炎帝。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji043-182","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","surfaces":["神農"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p071","quote":"趙文、趙造、周袑、趙俊皆諫止王毋胡服，如故法便。王曰：「先王不同俗，何古之法？帝王不相襲，何禮之循？虙戲、神農教而不誅，黃帝、堯、舜誅而不怒。及至三王，隨時制法，因事制禮。法度制令各順其宜，衣服器械各便其用。故禮也不必一道，而便國不必古。聖人之興也不相襲而王，夏、殷之衰也不易禮而滅。然則反古未可非，而循禮未足多也。且服奇者志淫，則是鄒、魯無奇行也；俗辟者民易，則是吳、越無秀士也。且聖人利身謂之服，便事謂之禮。夫進退之節，衣服之制者，所以齊常民也，非所以論賢者也。故齊民與俗流，賢者與變倶。故諺曰『以書御者不盡馬之情，以古制今者不達事之變』。循法之功，不足以髙世；法古之學，不足以制今。子不及也。」遂胡服招騎射。"}],"rationale":"限本篇人物、連續政治事件及明示生子是為敘事；武靈王／主父、王子何／惠文王及惠后吳娃按本文連接。公子章不與早期敬侯章合併，何不與較早趙何合併；髙信與信期、趙袑與周袑分候選。王賁不按熟知秦將同名接人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji043-shennong-crosschapter","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","surfaces":["神農"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao","c-shiji-061-boyi","c-shiji-129-huozhi","c-songshu-060-xunbozi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p071","quote":"趙文、趙造、周袑、趙俊皆諫止王毋胡服，如故法便。王曰：「先王不同俗，何古之法？帝王不相襲，何禮之循？虙戲、神農教而不誅，黃帝、堯、舜誅而不怒。及至三王，隨時制法，因事制禮。法度制令各順其宜，衣服器械各便其用。故禮也不必一道，而便國不必古。聖人之興也不相襲而王，夏、殷之衰也不易禮而滅。然則反古未可非，而循禮未足多也。且服奇者志淫，則是鄒、魯無奇行也；俗辟者民易，則是吳、越無秀士也。且聖人利身謂之服，便事謂之禮。夫進退之節，衣服之制者，所以齊常民也，非所以論賢者也。故齊民與俗流，賢者與變倶。故諺曰『以書御者不盡馬之情，以古制今者不達事之變』。循法之功，不足以髙世；法古之學，不足以制今。子不及也。」遂胡服招騎射。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0053"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:p005","quote":"武王已平殷亂，天下宗周，而伯夷、叔齊恥之，義不食周粟，隱於首陽山，采薇而食之。及餓且死，作歌。其辭曰：「登彼西山兮，采其薇矣。以暴易暴兮，不知其非矣。神農、虞、夏忽焉沒兮，我安適歸矣？于嗟徂兮，命之衰矣！」","mention_ids":["c-shiji-061-boyi:m005-0075"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:p002","quote":"太史公曰：夫神農以前，吾不知已。至若詩書所述虞夏以來，耳目欲極聲色之好，口欲窮芻豢之味，身安逸樂，而心誇矜輓能之榮使。俗之漸民久矣，雖戶說以眇論，終不能化。故善者因之，其次利道之，其次教誨之，其次整齊之，最下者與之爭。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-129-huozhi:m002-0006"]},{"chapter_id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005","quote":"伯子為世子征虜功曹，國子博士。妻弟謝晦薦達之，入為尚書左丞，出補臨川內史。車騎將軍王弘稱之曰：「沈重不華，有平陽侯之風。」伯子常自矜廕籍之美，謂弘曰：「天下膏粱，唯使君與下官耳。宣明之徒，不足數也。」遷散騎常侍，本邑大中正。又上表曰：「伏見百官位次，陳留王在零陵王上，臣愚竊以為疑。昔武王剋殷，封神農之後於焦，黃帝之後於祝，帝堯之後於薊，帝舜之後於陳，夏後於𣏌，殷後於宋。𣏌、陳並為列國，而薊、祝、焦無聞焉。斯則褒崇所承，優於遠代之顯驗也。是以春秋次序諸侯，宋居𣏌、陳之上。考之近世，事亦有徵。晉泰始元年，詔賜山陽公劉康子弟一人爵關內侯，衞公姬署、宋侯孔紹子一人駙馬都尉。又泰始三年，太常上博士劉憙等議，稱衞公署於大晉在三恪之數，應降稱侯。臣以零陵王位宜在陳留之上。」從之。","mention_ids":["c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0148"]}],"rationale":"趙武靈王論古制引虙戲、神農與黃帝堯舜；伯夷采薇歌追慕神農虞夏；貨殖論神農以前；宋書荀伯子表論封神農之後。四處均為上古傳說人物或其時代／後裔的指稱，無區分多位神農的證據，合為同一傳說身份。此為跨篇人物辨識，不證傳說史實，不將神農自動接炎帝，也不從後裔泛稱補具名世系。山居賦醫藥引書神農及晉書羲農省稱另留未決。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji061-018","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","surfaces":["神農"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-061-boyi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:p005","quote":"武王已平殷亂，天下宗周，而伯夷、叔齊恥之，義不食周粟，隱於首陽山，采薇而食之。及餓且死，作歌。其辭曰：「登彼西山兮，采其薇矣。以暴易暴兮，不知其非矣。神農、虞、夏忽焉沒兮，我安適歸矣？于嗟徂兮，命之衰矣！」"}],"rationale":"依明示姓名、局部父稱、西伯卒號文王及孔子顏淵評論語境暫接；由光只取所聞由光處，子曰只標子，不全域按單字替換。傳說敘事、世系數目、源文引語及普通詞分辨，未名人物不補全名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-songshu060-cross-011","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","surfaces":["神農"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-songshu-060-xunbozi","c-shiji-061-boyi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"medium","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0148","c-shiji-061-boyi:m005-0075"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-060","source_id":"s-songshu-060-xunbozi","chapter_id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005","quote":"伯子為世子征虜功曹，國子博士。妻弟謝晦薦達之，入為尚書左丞，出補臨川內史。車騎將軍王弘稱之曰：「沈重不華，有平陽侯之風。」伯子常自矜廕籍之美，謂弘曰：「天下膏粱，唯使君與下官耳。宣明之徒，不足數也。」遷散騎常侍，本邑大中正。又上表曰：「伏見百官位次，陳留王在零陵王上，臣愚竊以為疑。昔武王剋殷，封神農之後於焦，黃帝之後於祝，帝堯之後於薊，帝舜之後於陳，夏後於𣏌，殷後於宋。𣏌、陳並為列國，而薊、祝、焦無聞焉。斯則褒崇所承，優於遠代之顯驗也。是以春秋次序諸侯，宋居𣏌、陳之上。考之近世，事亦有徵。晉泰始元年，詔賜山陽公劉康子弟一人爵關內侯，衞公姬署、宋侯孔紹子一人駙馬都尉。又泰始三年，太常上博士劉憙等議，稱衞公署於大晉在三恪之數，應降稱侯。臣以零陵王位宜在陳留之上。」從之。"},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-061","source_id":"s-shiji-061-boyi","chapter_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:p005","quote":"武王已平殷亂，天下宗周，而伯夷、叔齊恥之，義不食周粟，隱於首陽山，采薇而食之。及餓且死，作歌。其辭曰：「登彼西山兮，采其薇矣。以暴易暴兮，不知其非矣。神農、虞、夏忽焉沒兮，我安適歸矣？于嗟徂兮，命之衰矣！」"}],"rationale":"與黃帝、帝堯、帝舜並列的傳說帝名，暫接伯夷列傳已錄神農候選；本處不提供遠古世系確證。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016","text":"時天下暫寧，頠奏修國學，刻石寫經。皇太子既講，釋奠祀孔子，飲饗射侯，甚有儀序。又令荀籓終父勖之志，鑄鐘鑿磬，以備郊廟朝享禮樂。頠通博多聞，兼明醫術。荀勖之修律度也，檢得古尺，短世所用四分有餘。頠上言：「宜改諸度量。若未能悉革，可先改太醫權衡。此若差違，遂失神農、岐伯之正。藥物輕重，分兩乖互，所可傷夭，為害尤深。古壽考而今短折者，未必不由此也。」卒不能用。樂廣嘗與頠清言，欲以理服之，而頠辭論豐博，廣笑而不言。時人謂頠為言談之林藪。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"皇太子","kind":"person","person_id":"74e_68c_9ae","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"惠帝朝頠侍臣，接下段賈后不悅之太子及p020湣懷太子，與現役同一太子；不以官名太子中庶子造額外提及。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"釋奠祀孔子為儒家先師，首選既有孔子主身份，不按同名候選隨機選號。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"荀籓","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_FAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"勖","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_FAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"荀勖","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_FAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"神農岐伯之正指醫藥先賢並稱，人物典故而非本段引書；保留legendary_tradition，不接炎帝。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"岐伯","kind":"person","person_id":"l4l_iz8_ao0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"神農岐伯之正的醫藥先賢。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"樂廣","kind":"person","person_id":"591_360_8ca","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0193","start":193,"end":194,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"591_360_8ca","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p016:m0208","start":208,"end":209,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","status":"source_explicit"}],"source_position":{"first_line":50,"last_line":50,"revision_id":2506399,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/jin035-peixiu-peiwei/raw-projection.json","unit_key":"line050","raw_file_sha256":"b27aa9fc386b5f40990822d615febffcb8b8cd6df3fe6f74585274ff733c12be"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p071","text":"趙文、趙造、周袑、趙俊皆諫止王毋胡服，如故法便。王曰：「先王不同俗，何古之法？帝王不相襲，何禮之循？虙戲、神農教而不誅，黃帝、堯、舜誅而不怒。及至三王，隨時制法，因事制禮。法度制令各順其宜，衣服器械各便其用。故禮也不必一道，而便國不必古。聖人之興也不相襲而王，夏、殷之衰也不易禮而滅。然則反古未可非，而循禮未足多也。且服奇者志淫，則是鄒、魯無奇行也；俗辟者民易，則是吳、越無秀士也。且聖人利身謂之服，便事謂之禮。夫進退之節，衣服之制者，所以齊常民也，非所以論賢者也。故齊民與俗流，賢者與變倶。故諺曰『以書御者不盡馬之情，以古制今者不達事之變』。循法之功，不足以髙世；法古之學，不足以制今。子不及也。」遂胡服招騎射。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"趙文","kind":"person","person_id":"ue1_qha_ehn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"趙造","kind":"person","person_id":"bfv_clh_n6y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"周袑","kind":"person","person_id":"0q2_ioh_psy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"趙俊","kind":"person","person_id":"ybw_y4h_z69","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"txj_z8z_5me_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"txj_z8z_5me_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"先王泛稱，不連當前武靈王。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"帝王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"虙戲","kind":"person","person_id":"xop_byp_p7d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"mnl_vz0_79n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"fw9_g5w_om8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"smu_ylv_x6g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"三王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:p005","text":"武王已平殷亂，天下宗周，而伯夷、叔齊恥之，義不食周粟，隱於首陽山，采薇而食之。及餓且死，作歌。其辭曰：「登彼西山兮，采其薇矣。以暴易暴兮，不知其非矣。神農、虞、夏忽焉沒兮，我安適歸矣？于嗟徂兮，命之衰矣！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m005-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"伯夷","kind":"person","person_id":"eh7_raa_ap6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m005-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"叔齊","kind":"person","person_id":"ktv_rwx_hp3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m005-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m005-0078","start":78,"end":81,"surface":"虞、夏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi","book_id":"b-shiji-061","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-061-boyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:p002","text":"太史公曰：夫神農以前，吾不知已。至若詩書所述虞夏以來，耳目欲極聲色之好，口欲窮芻豢之味，身安逸樂，而心誇矜輓能之榮使。俗之漸民久矣，雖戶說以眇論，終不能化。故善者因之，其次利道之，其次教誨之，其次整齊之，最下者與之爭。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m002-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m002-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi","book_id":"b-shiji-129","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji129-huozhi"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005","text":"伯子為世子征虜功曹，國子博士。妻弟謝晦薦達之，入為尚書左丞，出補臨川內史。車騎將軍王弘稱之曰：「沈重不華，有平陽侯之風。」伯子常自矜廕籍之美，謂弘曰：「天下膏粱，唯使君與下官耳。宣明之徒，不足數也。」遷散騎常侍，本邑大中正。又上表曰：「伏見百官位次，陳留王在零陵王上，臣愚竊以為疑。昔武王剋殷，封神農之後於焦，黃帝之後於祝，帝堯之後於薊，帝舜之後於陳，夏後於𣏌，殷後於宋。𣏌、陳並為列國，而薊、祝、焦無聞焉。斯則褒崇所承，優於遠代之顯驗也。是以春秋次序諸侯，宋居𣏌、陳之上。考之近世，事亦有徵。晉泰始元年，詔賜山陽公劉康子弟一人爵關內侯，衞公姬署、宋侯孔紹子一人駙馬都尉。又泰始三年，太常上博士劉憙等議，稱衞公署於大晉在三恪之數，應降稱侯。臣以零陵王位宜在陳留之上。」從之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"伯子","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BABAAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"世子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"世子征虜府的主人，仍待官歷與年代核定。"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"妻","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"謝晦","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"王弘","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"平陽侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"人物比擬用稱，待平行文獻核定所指；不作荀伯子爵號。"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"伯子","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BABAAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"使君","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"下官","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BABAAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"宣明","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0125","start":125,"end":128,"surface":"陳留王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"禮秩及前代之後的制度性稱呼，此處未逕指定某代持有者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0129","start":129,"end":132,"surface":"零陵王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"禮秩及前代之後的制度性稱呼，此處未逕指定某代持有者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0148","start":148,"end":150,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"kzy_ysk_775","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0155","start":155,"end":157,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"8jz_o3s_obt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"帝堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"帝舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"夏後","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"群體後裔，未造個人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0181","start":181,"end":183,"surface":"殷後","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"群體後裔，未造個人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0258","start":258,"end":260,"surface":"劉康","kind":"person","person_id":"5yv_wvs_bn0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0260","start":260,"end":264,"surface":"子弟一人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"劉康之未名子弟一人，不逕定為兒子或弟弟。"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0271","start":271,"end":273,"surface":"姬署","kind":"person","person_id":"89l_z1s_rlj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0276","start":276,"end":278,"surface":"孔紹","kind":"person","person_id":"1xh_hsv_sxp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0278","start":278,"end":281,"surface":"子一人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"孔紹之未名子，駙馬都尉受官者不是孔紹本人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"劉憙","kind":"person","person_id":"056_l3j_x1e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0303","start":303,"end":306,"surface":"衞公署","kind":"person","person_id":"89l_z1s_rlj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p005:m0322","start":322,"end":325,"surface":"零陵王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"禮秩及前代之後的制度性稱呼，此處未逕指定某代持有者。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":99,"last_line":100,"revision_id":1996694,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi","book_id":"b-songshu-060","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-060-xunbozi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","source":{"title":"《晉書・裴秀裴頠傳》","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7035&oldid=2506399","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7035&oldid=2506399","revision_id":2506399,"accessed_on":"2026-10-21","extent":"裴秀傳及子頠附傳完整單元，固定原文第18–75行；止秀從弟楷前，不含裴楷或全卷。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_statu